# Nothing ROM-derived belongs in this repository. The ROM itself, the assets
# pulled out of it, the disassembly splat emits, and the ELF we build from them
# are all reproducible from a legally obtained baserom.z64. None of them is a
# source of truth, and all of them are Nintendo's data rather than ours.
*.z64
*.bin
/assets/
/asm/
/build/
*.elf
*.ld
*.map
*.o
*.d
*.out
.splache
.ninja*

# splat's own bookkeeping.
.splat/
expected/
nonmatchings/
*undefined_funcs_auto.txt
*undefined_syms_auto.txt

# The Python environment splat runs in.
__pycache__/
venv/
.venv/

.vscode/
